@SmartRouter_HostAddress = http://localhost:5178
@contentType = application/json

###############################################################################
# 1. DIAGNOSTICS & HEALTH ENDPOINTS
###############################################################################

### 1.1 Gateway Readiness & Health Check
# Returns gateway operational status, version and UTC timestamp
GET {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.2 Circuit Breaker Telemetry & Status
# Checks real-time circuit state (Closed/Open/HalfOpen), failure ratio and counters
GET {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/health/circuit
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.3 OpenAPI Specification
# Retrieves generated OpenAPI v3 documentation document
GET {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.4 Providers Health Report
GET {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/health/providers
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 1.5 Providers Live Health Report
GET {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/health/providers?live=true
Accept: {{contentType}}

###############################################################################
# 2. CHAT COMPLETIONS (POST /v1/chat/completions)
###############################################################################

### 2.1 Heuristic Economy Tier (Prompt < 1000 characters)
# Routes to Economic provider (OpenRouter / Cohere) based on character threshold heuristic
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Explique brevemente o padrão Circuit Breaker em microsserviços."
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2.2 Heuristic Premium Tier (Prompt >= 1000 characters)
# Prompt exceeds CharacterThresholdForPremiumTier (1000 chars), routing to Premium provider (Gemini)
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Por favor, analise detalhadamente a arquitetura de software descrita a seguir e aponte riscos de acoplamento, gargalos de escalabilidade e oportunidades de melhoria segundo os princípios do Domain-Driven Design (DDD) e Clean Architecture. Contexto da arquitetura: Nosso ecossistema possui um Gateway Minimal API em .NET 10 que gerencia múltiplos provedores de Large Language Models. Ele implementa uma estratégia heurística baseada no número de caracteres da requisição: prompts com menos de 1000 caracteres são direcionados para um provedor econômico de alta taxa de transferência e baixo custo, enquanto prompts que atingem ou excedem esse limiar são roteados automaticamente para provedores avançados de raciocínio profundo como o Gemini e modelos de alta capacidade. Além da heurística estática, a infraestrutura implementa um Circuit Breaker com amostragem contínua e failover automático caso o provedor primário sofra degradação de latência ou erros de rede. Como você estruturaria os bounded contexts e as camadas de aplicação para suportar auditoria de custos por token e resiliência reativa sem comprometer o throughput?"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2.3 Explicit Tier Preference: Economy
# Explicit directive overrides heuristic and forces Economy tier
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "routeTierPreference": "Economy",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Qual é a diferença entre IAsyncEnumerable e IEnumerable no C#?"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2.4 Explicit Tier Preference: Premium
# Explicit directive overrides heuristic and forces Premium tier (Gemini) even with a short prompt
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "routeTierPreference": "Premium",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Resuma a teoria da relatividade geral em uma única frase poética."
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2.5 Custom Sampling Parameters & Specific Model
# Passes temperature, maxTokens and a target model
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
  "temperature": 0.2,
  "maxTokens": 150,
  "routeTierPreference": "Premium",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Liste 3 boas práticas essenciais para implementação de APIs RESTful."
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2.6 Multi-Turn Conversation with System Prompt
# Demonstrates context preservation with system, user, and assistant roles
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "temperature": 0.3,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "Você é um arquiteto de software sênior focado em Clean Architecture e boas práticas em .NET."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Onde devem ficar as interfaces dos repositórios na Clean Architecture?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "As interfaces dos repositórios devem residir no núcleo da aplicação (Domain ou Application Core), garantindo que a camada de negócio não dependa de detalhes de infraestrutura."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "E onde deve ficar a implementação concreta que usa EF Core?"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2.7 Validation Error - Bad Request (Empty Messages)
# Expects HTTP 400 Bad Request
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "messages": []
}

###


###############################################################################
# 3. STREAMING CHAT (POST /v1/chat/stream - Server-Sent Events)
###############################################################################

### 3.1 Reactive Streaming (SSE) - Economy Route
# Streams tokens asynchronously via text/event-stream using default heuristic
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Conte uma história curta sobre um robô que descobriu a música clássica."
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3.2 Reactive Streaming (SSE) - Explicit Premium Route
# Streams tokens via Server-Sent Events forcing Premium tier
POST {{SmartRouter_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "routeTierPreference": "Premium",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Escreva um soneto sobre computação quântica e criptografia."
    }
  ]
}

###
